  "prefLabel": "He-W 553.04 Provider Participation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 553.04 Provider Participation.\n\n(a) All home health care providers shall:\n\n(1) Hold a current New Hampshire state license as a home health care provider, in accordance with RSA 151:2-b, I, and He-P 809;\n\n(2) Be certified to participate in the medicare program; and\n\n(3) Be a New Hampshire enrolled medicaid provider.\n\n(b) When there is no licensed and certified home health care provider in the area, an independent nurse may provide skilled nursing services if the independent nurse:\n\n(1) Is currently licensed to practice in the state in which he or she practices;\n\n(2) Receives written orders from the recipient’s physician;\n\n(3) Documents the care and services provided in accordance with He-W 553.05; and\n\n(4) Is a NH enrolled medicaid provider.\n\nSource. #8972, eff 9-11-07; ss by #11127, eff 7-1-16 (formerly He-W 553.03) (See Revision Note at part heading for He-W 553)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
